; Editor-owned Boardwalk scenery pass. The generated I2/I3/B1-B4 shells remain
; collision and weather backing; every visible identity piece below is directly
; selectable and reshapeable in Godot. Coordinates are local to the approved
; layout footprints, so no generated source owns these artistic forms.

